# The impeccable design hook writes a per-session cache keyed by ABSOLUTE paths. The root one is
# tracked and predates this rule; nested per-app copies must never be committed, because they embed
# machine paths (AGENTS.md forbids those in committed files) and they fail the formatter check.
passion/apps/*/.impeccable/
apps/*/.impeccable/
